trim_stub.c、trimvfs_stub.c 里的 __weak 桩都已有真实实现;
trimvfs.c 改为包含 trim_trashbin/trim_trashbin.h。
合并后 fs/ 全量比对: 一致 2569、≈ 4、不一致 45
(本步 8 个为编译排布差异, 其余为 stable 修复或头文件布局连带)。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 fs/Makefile       |  3 +--
 fs/trim_stub.c    | 69 -----------------------------------------------
 fs/trimvfs.c      |  2 +-
 fs/trimvfs_stub.c |  9 -------
 4 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 81 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100755 fs/trim_stub.c
 delete mode 100755 fs/trimvfs_stub.c

diff --git a/fs/Makefile b/fs/Makefile
index 05338d7fa..49f8aea1b 100644
--- a/fs/Makefile
+++ b/fs/Makefile
@@ -17,8 +17,7 @@ obj-y :=	open.o read_write.o file_table.o super.o \
 		fs_types.o fs_context.o fs_parser.o fsopen.o init.o \
 		kernel_read_file.o mnt_idmapping.o remap_range.o pidfs.o \
 		file_attr.o
-obj-$(CONFIG_FS_TRIM_ACL)	+= trimvfs.o trimvfs_stub.o	# trimvfs_stub: trim_trashbin 临时桩
-obj-$(CONFIG_FS_TRIM_ACL)	+= trim_stub.o	# 临时桩, 第 6 步完成后删除
+obj-$(CONFIG_FS_TRIM_ACL)	+= trimvfs.o
 
 obj-$(CONFIG_BUFFER_HEAD)	+= buffer.o mpage.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_PROC_FS)		+= proc_namespace.o
diff --git a/fs/trim_stub.c b/fs/trim_stub.c
deleted file mode 100755
index d3db0d660..000000000
--- a/fs/trim_stub.c
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,69 +0,0 @@
